Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 我们本该从教会中消除偶像崇拜与迷信\N{\fnArial\fs30}How in God's name, we suppose to bannish by adultery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.48,0:02:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}废除宗教仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}and superstition and empty ritual from our churches.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.99,0:02:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却不期然它们依旧在宫内大行其道\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they are still practice here at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何时我可觐见陛下 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}When shall I meet the Majesty, my lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.37,0:02:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很快 陛下也热切期待与你会谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}very soon. Majesty is most eager to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.19,0:02:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时他鼓励您书写一份详尽供述\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime, he encouraged you to write a lengthy declaration of.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.41,0:02:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来细述叛乱之缘由 及你的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything you did during the rebellion and the reasons for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.07,0:03:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep still.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.34,0:03:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是谁 来此作甚\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are you? what are you doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.23,0:03:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能来此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天哪 居然真是这样 我真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God, it's true. I didn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.63,0:03:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出去 出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}get out. get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.06,0:03:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行 她是我的未婚妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}no. she is my fiancee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.25,0:03:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 请允许我… - 不 我不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, should I…? - No, I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.32,0:03:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不许来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no cause being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.76,0:03:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我警告过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.43,0:03:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还活着么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.55,0:03:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}荷尔拜因大师求见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Holbein.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 荷尔拜因大师 - 参见陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Master Holbein. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得请求陛下宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must beg Your Majesty's pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宽恕？所为何事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon? What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.27,0:04:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在您的宫中犯有殴打行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have committed an assault within the verge of your court.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.78,0:04:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}殴打 你 但是你不过是个艺术家啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}An assault? you? But you're an artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.62,0:04:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}受陛下委派 我在为米赛尔登女士画像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was painting the picture of Lady Misseldon that Your Majesty commisioned,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.50,0:04:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是有位绅士前来阻隔\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a gentleman interrupted us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.64,0:04:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你做了何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把那位绅士推倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I threw the gentleman into some shelves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.42,0:04:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您做的对 荷尔拜因大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did the right thing, Master Holbein.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我完全宽恕你 换作是我也会那么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll forgive you freely, I might have done the same thing myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.18,0:04:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请去完成画作吧 我迫不及待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just finish the portrait. I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.33,0:04:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}荷尔拜因大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Holbein.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.72,0:04:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特·泰维斯托克爵士求见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Robert Tavistock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:05:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 罗伯特爵士 您看起来受到过攻击 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir Robert, you look have assaults. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我前来严正投诉荷尔拜因大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a great complaints to make against Master Holbein.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我与一位女士订过婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am engaged to a young woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.32,0:05:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却发现他在给她画像 而她全身赤裸\N{\fnArial\fs30}but found him painting her. Naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.23,0:05:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}裸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naked?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 陛下 在床上 如同荡妇一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty. on a bed, like some concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.39,0:05:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我强烈要求陛下为其邪恶 不道德 以及对我暴力侵犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I demanded that, Your Majesty, punish Mr. Holbein severely, for his lewdness,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.99,0:05:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}严惩荷尔拜因先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}his immorality, and his violence against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.88,0:05:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此事不必针对荷尔拜因先生 冲我来好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have not to do with Mr Holbein, but with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.07,0:05:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我实话告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you frankly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.81,0:05:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我有7个农夫 我可以造就7个贵族大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I have seven peasants, I can make seven lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.69,0:05:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我有7个贵族大人 也造就不出一个荷尔拜因\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if I have seven lords, I couldn't make one Holbein.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.16,0:05:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在如实告诉我 你还希望我惩处荷尔拜因先生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then tell me truthfully, do you still wish me to punish Mr. Holbein?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.15,0:05:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 陛下 我请求陛下宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Your Majesty. I ask for Your Majesty's pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.16,0:05:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是陛下的恭顺忠仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Your Majesty's humble and obedient servant,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.85,0:05:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不再投诉荷尔拜因先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make no complaints against Mr. Holbein.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.97,0:06:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好小伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.25,0:06:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣诞快乐 罗伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy Christmas, Robert.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty? - Sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.13,0:06:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以向您引见某人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I present someone to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.59,0:06:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}索尔兹伯里女伯爵曾是我的家教\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Countess of Salisbury was my old governess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.21,0:06:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道 我很了解这位女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know the Lady very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.85,0:06:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 玛格丽特女士 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lady Margaret? - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常欢迎你来宫中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are very welcome here to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.25,0:06:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你鲜少踏离您的华宅豪居\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how rearly you quit your fine house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这倒是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.03,0:06:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜欢虔诚传统的生活方式 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer to live a life based on piety and traditional ways, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.65,0:06:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您是宫中所有人的榜样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an example to everyone here at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的儿子波尔红衣主教近来如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was your son, Reginald Pole?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还在意大利就学吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he still studying in Italy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.48,0:06:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, indeed, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.61,0:06:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他现在帕多瓦大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is now at Padua Univeristy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.77,0:07:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对陛下不胜感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}and has more reasons than most to be grateful to Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为不久之前 你还资助过他的学费\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since until very recently, you continue to pay his fees.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾对他非常属意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I showed great interest in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是我的表亲 展现了成就学者的良好前景\N{\fnArial\fs30}He showed great promise as scholar, as well as being my cousin,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.44,0:07:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 在他拒绝了我册封他为有史以来最年轻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, when you refused my offer to make him the youngest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.13,0:07:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}温切斯特大主教职位之际\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever Bishop of Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得我只好抛弃他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remeber I had to thump him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.87,0:07:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下务必相信*从红衣主教方面来说此事并无裨益\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty must believe it was not in gratitude on Reginald's part. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.51,0:07:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在失去陛下眷顾之际着实热泪盈眶\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was in tears after leaving Your Majesty's presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.83,0:07:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上犬子相对于担任社会公职或出人头地来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is my son is too much of a scholar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.22,0:07:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更倾向于做一位离群索居的学者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and private person ever to desire public office or notoriety.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然如此 我原谅他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then after all, I forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.46,0:07:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 索尔兹伯里女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - Lady Salisbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.24,0:08:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们两位女士在密谋什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ladies are conspiring something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.57,0:08:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们俩希望在此圣诞之际向您引见某人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were both like to present someone else to Your Majesty at this Christmastide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.61,0:08:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.73,0:08:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 这位是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, this is…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.27,0:08:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我女儿伊丽莎白 不用你来告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter Elizabeth. You don't need to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.29,0:08:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来吧 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.29,0:09:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[法语]参见陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Votre Majeste.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.07,0:09:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[法语]您好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ca va.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.01,0:09:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[法语]我很好 小乖乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ca va bien, ma petite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[法语]来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Veniez ici.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attencion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阖家欢乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joyeux son famille.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.50,0:09:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 罗伯特·阿斯克已到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, Mr. Robert Aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - Mr.Aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.51,0:10:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.64,0:10:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很高兴见到你 阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am very glad to see you, Mr. Aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.85,0:10:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长久以来 我相信我被严重误传了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a long time, I believed I was badly misinformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.30,0:10:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于王国北部地区动乱缘由\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the causes of disturbances in the Northern part of our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.92,0:10:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经阅读了你那份详尽坦诚的诉说\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I have read your full and frank explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.07,0:10:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我被你们起事所诉求的公义所折服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am persuaded by the justice of your cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.36,0:10:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我依然将热爱我的臣民视为王国之维\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still deem the commonwealth of the realm, and love of my subjects,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}远远胜于对任何财富的渴求 阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Aske, far more than any riches.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.87,0:10:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下言语让小人担当不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm truely humbled by Your Majesty's words.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.29,0:10:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在此斗胆请陛下明示\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ask in all you ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.87,0:10:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下是否将会履行沙福克公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your sacred Majesty intends to fulfill those pledges made in Your Majesty's name,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.89,0:10:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在庞蒂弗拉克特以陛下的名义所做的诸般承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}by his grace, the Duke of Suffolk at Pontefract.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的一切都会履行\N{\fnArial\fs30}In every part, the general and liberal pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.91,0:10:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大赦将可延伸至所有北方臣民\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall be extended to all our Northern subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.11,0:11:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将在约克郡自由选举新一届议会\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be a free election to a Parliament to be held at York.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.03,0:11:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教士们不受我们的好恶所左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}when members of churchmen without our displeasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.02,0:11:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们可以畅所欲言 直抒胸臆\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall them may speak and show their learning and their free minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不仅如此 在我的沙福克公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Futhermore, after my Lord Suffolk has come down to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}携带王玺确定上述诸等事宜之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the great seal to claim on this,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.64,0:11:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为明示我们对北方臣民的挚爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}then to show the great love we bear on the Northern subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.23,0:11:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们将亲自前往约克郡\N{\fnArial\fs30}we ourselves shall come to York.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并在该地为我的王后举行加冕礼 阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it is there, Mr. Aske, where my Queen shall be crowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.65,0:11:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下真是宽宏无量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty is truely gracious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.78,0:11:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向您发誓 您将发现王国之内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to you. You will find no more loving and loyal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有比北部约克郡更爱 更忠于吾王的子民\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the whole of your realm than Northern Yorkshire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尚有一事 你信中非议某些大臣\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more thing. You've written against some of my advisors,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.18,0:11:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}质疑他们缺乏贵族血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}and protesting at their lack of noble blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.90,0:11:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.85,0:11:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不必 我其实认同于你 不过切莫声张\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I agree with you. But don't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.90,0:12:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 我有件礼物给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I have a gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣诞快乐 阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy Christmas, Mr. Aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.14,0:13:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相当愉悦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is quite entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过你兴许还不知道我是谁 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you don't even know who I am, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.99,0:13:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.22,0:13:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是爱德华·西摩的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Edward Seymour's wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.78,0:13:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倘若他发现此事 或许会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he ever discovered us, he'd probably kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.69,0:13:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的 他看起来友好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Yet he seems so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有点冷静 不过与人为善\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold, perhaps but pleasant with all?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是所有人的错觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a mistake they all make.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.82,0:13:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[拉丁语]万福玛利亚 满被圣宠者 主与尔偕焉 阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ave Maria, gratia plena, Dominus tecum, Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.69,0:13:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.86,0:14:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.10,0:14:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉打搅了您祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to disturb your prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.17,0:14:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一点也不 我一直在为您祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all, since you are always a part of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.76,0:14:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我前来是为了让您放宽心 阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come only to assure you, Mr. Aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.60,0:14:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我知道您是受主的差遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}For I know you are here upon God's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.50,0:14:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信国王陛下会满足你们的要求的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust the King's Majesty will grant you and your people all their desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在充满了希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have every hope now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像我一直都希望有一天您可以成为英格兰的女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I have ever hoped one day you will succeed as Queen of England,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.18,0:14:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以更好地维护我们的信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the better maintaining of our faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.98,0:14:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽女士 你要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady, you must know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.66,0:14:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人民有多么的爱戴你\N{\fnArial\fs30}how beloved you are to the people,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就如同昔日爱戴先慈一样 愿她的灵魂安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}as was your mother before you. God rest her soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望这个信物可以让你一直记得我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember me by this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.17,0:15:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但愿上帝保佑并眷顾你 阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}May God bless and keep you, Master Aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.69,0:15:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲可好？听说他病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's father? They told me he has fallen ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.63,0:15:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我本想换个时间告诉你的 父亲去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going tell you at a better time. Father is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去世了？什么时候？怎么会？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead? When? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}注意保持微笑 一周以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep smiling. A week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.97,0:15:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 一周了？ - 是的 一周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A week? - Yes a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我安排了葬礼 他已风光大葬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I arrange the funeral, everything has done to honor him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.49,0:15:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我本不想现在告诉你 我本该参加葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have told me. I should have been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.40,0:15:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也希望我有别的办法 但是现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could be otherwise, but can't now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.12,0:15:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你属于王宫 你得理解这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}your place is here, you have to understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.17,0:16:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}择日你可去他的陵墓祭拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later you could visit his mausoleum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.11,0:16:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 妹妹 - 我的夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sister. - My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.73,0:16:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜你已经告诉她父亲的噩耗了 她还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I presume you have told her about her father, is she alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.44,0:16:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 她可是王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. She's the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.41,0:16:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们 高贵与虔诚的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen. Noble and worshipful man of this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.41,0:16:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以上帝和圣乔治的名义起誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear by the faith that I bear to God and St. George that I have not only.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会原谅宽恕北方的子民 我的承诺不仅只是落纸盖玺\N{\fnArial\fs30}forgiven and pardoned the men of the North by writing under seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.11,0:16:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的承诺同样发自肺腑\N{\fnArial\fs30}but also freely in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.39,0:16:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很荣幸 这些带着圣乔治十字的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my honor that those men now wear the cross of St. George.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.24,0:16:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我的赦免满怀感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}who thankfully accepted my free pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.10,0:16:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且会像起义前一样 愿意做忠实的臣民\N{\fnArial\fs30}and mean to be as loyal subjects, as they were before their solely insurrection.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.30,0:17:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和王后 在此祝愿你们 新年快乐如意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my queen and I, wish you all, a very happy and prosperous New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.89,0:17:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我实实在在地告诉你们 国王是个和蔼可亲的君主\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you frankly, the King is a good and gracious lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.19,0:17:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他已经尽可能地满足了我们的请愿和诉求\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has granted us as far as he may, all our desires and petitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.19,0:17:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是真的 我听他亲口承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true. I heard it from his own mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.77,0:17:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他意欲在约克召开一届自由公正的议会\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he intends to hold a free and fair parliament in York.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且在这里为王后加冕\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have the queen crowned there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.94,0:17:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿斯克先生 承诺复承诺 承诺何其多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promises, Mr. Aske, just more promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不仅仅只是承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not just promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.58,0:17:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沙福克大人起誓 他会带着象征至高权威的国王御玺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Suffolk is sworn to come here to bring both great authority,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.52,0:17:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他给了许多让我满意的答覆\N{\fnArial\fs30}the King's seal and thus he told me many comfortable answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.54,0:17:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不得不说 阿斯克先生 虽然我赞同您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to tell you, Mr. Aske, though it agrees me to do so,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.88,0:17:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自从你出发之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}that since you have been away,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.87,0:17:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这儿谣言四起\N{\fnArial\fs30}there have been many rumors and a widespread.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.73,0:17:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家都觉得国王和他的枢密院不可信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}mistrust of the King and his councel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.43,0:17:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 北方要重建修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye. The Northern lands are open monastery again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.09,0:17:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次我们自己做主\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this time we won't be betrayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.35,0:17:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉他们要相信我 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them to believe me, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.76,0:18:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉他们静等沙福克公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them to wait for the coming of Lord Suffolk,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.78,0:18:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在再次起义简直是孤注一掷\N{\fnArial\fs30}for another rising now risks everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.80,0:18:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曾几何时 为王公者金口玉言一诺千金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robert, there was a time when nothing was more sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.49,0:18:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特 但如今…\N{\fnArial\fs30}than a promise of a prince, but now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.54,0:18:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们觉得那些承诺不过是愚弄臣民的权宜之计\N{\fnArial\fs30}we think these promises nothing but a policy to blind the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.96,0:18:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要再次起义 我们不会再轻信承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when we rise again, we will trust no promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.75,0:18:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我简直不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.73,0:18:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你们信不过国王 那能不能至少相信我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you will not trust the King, then will you at least trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.25,0:18:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道不是我一直以来指挥得当吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I not guided you well so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.11,0:18:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道不是我确保大家都被赦免吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I not secured a pardon for all of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.11,0:18:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你无法确保国王重建修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}But have you secured the King's absolute promise to restore our monasteries?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.03,0:18:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人向我保证这些事宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Grace promised me that all those matters would be discussed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.38,0:18:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都将在议会上畅所欲言的商讨\N{\fnArial\fs30}freely and openly in parliament.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.89,0:18:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信他 任何真诚善良的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust him. He offered me as much as true and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.99,0:18:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希冀君主所能做的 他都已经做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and good man could desire of their sovereign.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.15,0:18:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们没有任何保障\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we have no proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.74,0:19:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们要去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.60,0:19:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进军卡莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marching on Carlisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.08,0:19:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰 我恳求你 看在上帝的份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, I plead with you, for the love of God, not to put this agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}切勿鲁莽行事 这会破坏我们达成的协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}in jeopardy by false actions and rush judgements.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.26,0:19:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们早在你回来之前就已下定决心了 阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their minds are already made up, Mr. Aske. Even before you returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}压根就没有什么协定 只有空头承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no agreement just basically empty promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.09,0:19:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王可不会听劝 我们只有兵谏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King will not be moved by words but by actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.26,0:19:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们现在所将做的事 不过是我们早就该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall do now, what we should have done before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.36,0:19:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去召集大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}gather the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.07,0:19:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真希望玛丽公主能住在宫里 我很想念她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish that Lady Mary lived at the court. I miss her very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 还有伊丽莎白公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and Lady Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她可真是个甜美 聪明 开朗的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she not the sweetest, cleverest, brightest child?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.13,0:19:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她们两个都不容易 尽管我自己也挺悲惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not have been easy for either of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.64,0:19:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可和她们比起来 还是好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for all my troubles I'm glad I never have theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.57,0:19:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.75,0:20:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我不知道我是否该告诉你 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam. I do not know whether to tell you, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.25,0:20:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王已经纳米塞尔登女士为情妇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the King has taken Lady Misseldon as mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.95,0:20:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可以随心所欲 洛克福特女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must do as he will. It is we, Lady Rochford,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有我们女人 才必须贞洁恭顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}must always honor and obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别为我招惹是非 而我已有大喜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donot leave trouble for me, for I have great reason to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沙福克公爵和掌玺大臣觐见\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Duke of Suffolk, and the Lord Privy Seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.35,0:21:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你立马动身去北部\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to North at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.80,0:21:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了建立起绝对的服从 你要起草一份誓词\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order to establish due obedience, you will allow minister an oath,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给那些约克郡和兰开夏郡的士绅大人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the leaders and gentlemen of Yorkshire and Lancashire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.97,0:21:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们要承认 他们曾做出过\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will acknowledge that they made other oath contrary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.93,0:21:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叛君背主的誓约\N{\fnArial\fs30}to their allegiance and to the great offence of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.77,0:21:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们必须弃绝那些誓约\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must utterly renounce them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.72,0:21:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且发誓做我们的诚实子民\N{\fnArial\fs30}and swear to be our true and faithful subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.35,0:21:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们必须承诺服从 甚至要不惜抛洒热血\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must commit themselves to obey and even to spill their blood to maintain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.66,0:21:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵从王法 并协助宗教特使执行任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}all our laws and to assist our church commissioners in their duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.91,0:21:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他们不发此誓言 那就不必对他们仁慈\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they will not take the oath, then there will be no clemency.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.11,0:22:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你需在抓捕这些人时保障自己安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will apprehend such persons where there is no danger to yourself. And they will,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.58,0:22:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后依法处决他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}by law, be judged to suffer execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.31,0:22:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于在约克召开议会之事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, what are your instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.43,0:22:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您有何指示 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}regarding the setting of the parliament at York?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以说 议会不得不延期\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may say there has been necessary delays.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.02,0:22:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 可我以名誉担保向他们做出了承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, I…I gave them my word upon my honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.05,0:22:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我来提醒一下公爵大人 叛变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me remind Your Grace that rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.42,0:22:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就等同于自求天谴\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the heinous sin which cries out to God for punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.33,0:22:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是罪中之罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the sin of the sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.47,0:22:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为 如果纲常崩坏 就会引发淫乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}For wether is no right order, there is only carnal liberty,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.82,0:22:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罪恶和糜烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}sin and Babylonian disorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.72,0:22:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些刁民无法无天祸乱整个王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}These wretched men have taken my whole realm without board.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.95,0:22:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}犯君罔上 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}as they have taken me, Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.85,0:22:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们必须 也必将为此付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have to and will be punished for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.93,0:23:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我十分赞同陛下 如果可以的话 我想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree with Your Majesty. If I might…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.33,0:23:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你给我住嘴 你不过是个贱民 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No you may not. You're low birth, Mr. Cromwell, deems you're unfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.52,0:23:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有资格干预国王事务 你们退下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}to meddle in the affairs of King's. You dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.42,0:23:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你好 查理 - 康斯特布尔首领\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey Charlie. - Captain Constable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.69,0:23:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大多数人都聚齐了 你看上去精神不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}So most men start together. You're in good spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.88,0:23:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 很高兴您终于到达了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, glad you are up for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.22,0:23:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好 余下的人明天会加入我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, the rest will be joining in us tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.28,0:23:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们将向卡莱尔进发 尽快攻击城堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will walk in the carlisle, we will attack the castle as soon as fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.09,0:23:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what we've got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.37,0:23:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.84,0:23:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兔子 你们打算拿兔子做什么？喂饱五千士兵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rabbits. So what are you going to do with that? Feed the five thousand?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.22,0:24:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 查理 蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus! Charlie! Stay low!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.58,0:24:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冲出去 冲出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out, out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.57,0:24:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.54,0:24:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给他点水喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.26,0:25:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 苍天啊 发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, what in God's name has happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.29,0:25:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一起进发 阿斯克先生 在卡莱尔那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We started together, Mr. Aske, near Carlisle,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.17,0:25:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准备充分 斗志昂扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}ready and eager to,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.68,0:25:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准备去进攻城堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}assault the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.50,0:25:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后 克里斯托弗·戴克爵士 和沙福克公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Sir Cristopher Dacre. and the Lord Suffolk,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.32,0:25:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带着人马从城堡里面冲了出来 挥矛就刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}came out of the castle with the men that brought these spears on those.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.29,0:25:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们惨遭血腥屠戮 被俘\N{\fnArial\fs30}and afterwards, men of bloody chains and captures, scalds.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.09,0:25:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我眼睁睁看着两个小伙子被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw my two boy slayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.55,0:25:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.89,0:25:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下们 我们完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sirs we are broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.57,0:25:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}康斯特布尔先生怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Mr. Constable?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.59,0:25:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被俘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.02,0:25:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.12,0:25:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可逮着他了 他们毁约了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got him. They broke their pledges.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.87,0:25:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我要觐见陛下 - 明白了 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean to see the King. - Yes, My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.17,0:26:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要在北方全面施行戒严令\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall impose martial law on whole of the North.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.88,0:26:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你是约翰·康斯特布尔？ - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John Constable? - Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.03,0:26:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你否认你是叛乱活动的首领么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you deny that you acted as a leader in captains of this rebellion?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.40,0:26:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不否认 我引以为荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm proud of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.52,0:26:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会被押解往伦敦接受进一步审讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to be taken to London and examined further as your action's motives.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.03,0:26:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是指刑讯吧 你答应会召开议会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you mean tortured, you promised us a parliament,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.89,0:27:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你撒谎了 你背叛了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you lied. you betrayed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.85,0:27:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从没打算信守诺言 是不是？公爵大人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never meant to of everything, did you, did you, Your Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.08,0:27:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是不愿放弃叛乱并签署誓词的人的名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here are the names of those who refuse to announce their actions and sign the oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.03,0:27:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有多少？ - 74个 都要被处决 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many? - 74, all to be executed, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.49,0:29:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情都已圆满解决 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was all well done Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.29,0:29:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您知道国王命令逮捕达西大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that it is his Majesty's order to arrest Lord Darcy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.79,0:29:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉尔夫·艾列克爵士和罗伯特·阿斯克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Ralph Ellerker and Robert Aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.45,0:29:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们被控为叛国罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are to be charged on suspicion of treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.45,0:29:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但对他们密而不宣\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they must not know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.30,0:29:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 希望您一定要了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace must surely know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.17,0:29:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿斯克先生 拉尔夫·艾列克爵士和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Mr.Aske Sir.Ralph and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.05,0:29:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都都公开坚决反对二次起义\N{\fnArial\fs30}were firmly and factly and openly against this new rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.77,0:29:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们过去 而且现在依然相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believed and believe still in the promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.59,0:30:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下的承诺与善意\N{\fnArial\fs30}and assureties and good gracious of the King's Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.88,0:30:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实如此 我们这里绝无反对国王的行为与想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is also true that nothing can be done or imagined here against the King's Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.08,0:30:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使我无法让枢密院与您了解这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I cannot let the council and you know of.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.16,0:30:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我绝对相信您对国王陛下的忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am assured of your loyalty to his Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.34,0:30:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而 国王要求你们和我同往南方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nevertheless, the King requires you travel south.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.26,0:30:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就最近发生的事件做出解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}with me to explain this recent events.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.10,0:30:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些事件看起来有违他的期望\N{\fnArial\fs30}which seems so contrary to his expressed hopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.11,0:30:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 如您所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace can see with your own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.96,0:30:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我年迈体弱 经不起旅途劳乏\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I am old and sick and unfit to travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.33,0:30:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请允许我说句实话 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to speak openly to Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.06,0:30:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然我热爱并且完全信任国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although I love and trust the King absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.80,0:30:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道他会永远对我心怀仁慈 公正对待\N{\fnArial\fs30}and know that he would always treat me justly and mercifully.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.70,0:30:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但某些枢密院成员就难说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can not say the same for some of his councillors.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.19,0:30:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确实害怕落入他们之手 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would rather fear to fall into their hands my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.82,0:31:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我再次向您保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to reassure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.12,0:31:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将给国王和枢密院致函为你们求情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will write a letter to both the King and council in all of your favours.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.56,0:31:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在走之前我会先给你们过目\N{\fnArial\fs30}and shall we show you before we leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.56,0:31:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是说 我们必须去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, we must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.90,0:31:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 这是王令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is the King's command.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.92,0:31:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只求上帝垂怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I say God has mercy on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.45,0:31:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑你平安 我亲爱的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless you and keep you, my own dear husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.49,0:31:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也要保重 亲爱的 我会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you too my darlings, but I shall be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.86,0:31:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信公爵大人的诚信\N{\fnArial\fs30}for I trust in the honestly of His Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.53,0:31:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他给我看了封信\N{\fnArial\fs30}He showed me a letter, it was written.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.64,0:31:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是为了我们写给枢密院的 全都是好话\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the council on our behalf and it was all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.02,0:32:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说对我们好感依旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he still charity for us and I doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.18,0:32:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为我们不会受到任何伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}any harm will come to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.21,0:32:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毕竟北方大部分地区都已平定\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, what could be gained by when the North most now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.05,0:32:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们怎会获罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}be appeased and quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.58,0:32:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的女儿 不要流泪 你可是约克郡姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then our daughters don't weap. Your yorkshire lass,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.98,0:32:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约克郡姑娘都意志坚定 就像你们的好母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yorkshire lass have iron in their souls just like your good mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.95,0:32:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们很快就会再见的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will see me again soon, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.25,0:32:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑您 阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless you Mr.aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.41,0:32:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑您 阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless you Mr.aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.62,0:32:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计们 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, march on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.24,0:32:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑您 阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless you Mr.aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.78,0:33:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看你又在吃鹌鹑蛋 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you eating quail's eggs again sweetheat?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.47,0:33:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨天你没吃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you not have those yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.76,0:33:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.47,0:33:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来我对它们的喜欢渐增\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seemed to have developed fondness of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.15,0:33:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常喜欢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especial fondness?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.03,0:33:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实 非常喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.61,0:33:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为某些原因 我需要鹌鹑蛋胜过一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}For some seasons, I desire quails eggs above anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.44,0:33:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 退下 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leave. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.31,0:33:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你是怀有身孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you are with child.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.73,0:33:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.21,0:34:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的至爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}My love.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.11,0:34:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.60,0:34:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰·康斯特布尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Constable.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.31,0:34:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这个作乱国王不可救药的首恶分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are a principal and irredeemable traitor and villian against the King's Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.96,0:34:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在劫难逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing can save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.62,0:34:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝 宽恕保佑我\N{\fnArial\fs30}OH Lord. forgive me, oh Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.94,0:34:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卫士 把他压倒在桌子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards, hold him down on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.33,0:34:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}耶稣啊 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet jesus, God, jesus,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.44,0:35:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dame you to hell. …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.30,0:35:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 这趟长途奔波差点要了达西大人的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Lord Darcy Your Grace I think the journey almost broken him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.27,0:35:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他歇息的地方已经安排妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}His lodge is taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.78,0:35:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是弗兰西斯·布赖恩爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Sir Francis Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.74,0:35:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 阿斯克先生 - 弗兰西斯爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Aske. - Sir Francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.11,0:35:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我奉命送您去伦敦塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have orders to commit you to the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.41,0:35:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 但是 - 这是为了你的安全着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but - it's for your own safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.61,0:35:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那里 你会住得很舒适\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be lodged comfortably enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.02,0:35:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生想问你几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Cromwell desires to ask you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.91,0:35:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我信任过您 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trusted you, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.52,0:35:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我起誓 我已经尽了全力 阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, I have done my best for you, Mr. Aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.22,0:36:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沙福克公爵驾到 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Duke of Suffolk, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.30,0:36:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要见我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.94,0:36:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.87,0:36:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说清楚 你想怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well explain yourself, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.99,0:36:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我收到一些情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have some reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.51,0:36:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你总是有情报 克伦威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always have reports Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.07,0:36:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这些非常有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these are very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.68,0:36:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些情报来自卡莱尔内部\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are reports from insides of Carlisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.06,0:36:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}涉及对那些试图叛乱国王者的审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}where he says a judgement agaginst rebels who attempeted to threaten His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.52,0:36:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切都做的合法妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything was done leagally and properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.47,0:36:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}74名叛乱者被审判并处决\N{\fnArial\fs30}74 rebels were jedgued and hanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.53,0:36:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问题就在这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.42,0:36:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都可确定的一点是\N{\fnArial\fs30}One point all of us agreed there were at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.34,0:36:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少有4万名在野武装叛乱者\N{\fnArial\fs30}40, 000 rebles armed and in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.05,0:36:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 大人仅判处74人有罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yet Your Grace found only 74 guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.48,0:37:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我处决的是头目和重犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hanged those with the leaders and most guilty insides rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.73,0:37:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当时在场听证过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had you actually been there to hear the evidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.88,0:37:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须诚实地告诉你 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must be honest with Your Grace, you had been accused of too great.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.17,0:37:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你被指控对那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}of leniency towards the rebels, towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.46,0:37:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不顺从的修道士们以及其他旧教支持者心慈手软\N{\fnArial\fs30}recalcitrant monks and other upholders of the old religion, it…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.01,0:37:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您是否全心全意镇压叛乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is disreputed whether you are in your heart and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.70,0:37:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是说您内心依然\N{\fnArial\fs30}fully engaged in struggle against the treasons, rebels or Wheather you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.98,0:37:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尊崇于教皇\N{\fnArial\fs30}in your heart still papist.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.60,0:37:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是谁 指控我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who? Accused me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.77,0:37:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.58,0:37:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 国王陛下命令你返回北方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consequently, his Majesty now demands your return North.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.13,0:37:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}采取适当而有效的措施镇压乱党\N{\fnArial\fs30}and carry out an proper and efficient reprisals against these rebels and treators.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.96,0:37:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要对他们施以雷霆手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are to make a terribly examples of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.53,0:38:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教会他们忠诚这种品质\N{\fnArial\fs30}And teach those parts of the virtues of loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.78,0:38:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}74个远远不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}74 is an inadequate number.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.99,0:38:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.04,0:38:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你问我事实的真相 我如实告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you asked me for the truth, I will answer that in all parts of the realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.59,0:38:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对修道院的破坏极大伤害了王国各地人心\N{\fnArial\fs30}men's heart were most hurt by the destruction of the abbeyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.08,0:38:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他们有理由相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becuase they thought perhaps with a reason that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.53,0:38:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是对英国所有宗教寺院的毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}this was the first fruits, of the destruction, of their whole religion in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.74,0:38:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里有一封你的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}This letter of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.28,0:38:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在1月19日安抚庞蒂弗拉克特城市长的信中写道\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the 19th of Jan., you wrote to reassure the mayor of common Pontefract.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.61,0:38:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我必须对上帝和国王忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I should keep a clean true heart to God on the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.37,0:38:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}成为国家利益着想的请愿者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and whatever more further to be a true petitioner for the common wealth good."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.52,0:38:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还签了名 T 达西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You signed it.T Dacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.41,0:39:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得 但是我不解何错之有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember it. But I am not sure, what is wrong with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.78,0:39:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你难道不承认 这更加暴露了你的错误愚昧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you not agree, was it rather spreading fauls foolingness.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.86,0:39:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如 我们准备要拆除的教区教堂实际上引发了叛乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}For example, the parish churches we're going to put down which actully caused rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.45,0:39:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 事实是修道院被查封\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it was the fact, that the abbeys were being suppressed and burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.35,0:39:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此函写于在国王宣布赦免和叛乱结束之后的1月19日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was 19th of Jan that after the King declared his Pardon and rebellion had ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.16,0:39:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想国王也曾答应过建立一个自由的议会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I understood the King had also agreed to a free paliament.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.69,0:39:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那里臣民依然可以陈述他们伤心的诉愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}where subjests could still show their grief complains.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.91,0:39:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的信只不过表示…\N{\fnArial\fs30}my letter was only meant to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.39,0:39:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来告诉你它表示着什么 我的大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will tell you what it meant, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.21,0:39:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它意味着即使在吾王宽赦之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}What it meant is even after the King's gracious pardon,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.61,0:39:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你却依然叛心不改\N{\fnArial\fs30}you had not changed your traitor's heart and opinions.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.68,0:39:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你仍然执迷于设法废除\N{\fnArial\fs30}You continue to seek the annulment of laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.50,0:39:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些为了国家安康而制定的法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}that make for the good of the commonwealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.04,0:39:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至你还想废黜国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you still wish to depose the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.25,0:39:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我 为什么它们对你那么重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, why… they were so important to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.93,0:40:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为北方的修道院给穷人以保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the abbeys in the North gave arms to poor men.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.95,0:40:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给贵族大人们以信念来侍奉上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Lord belief to serve God.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.10,0:40:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此乃国土之至美之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were one of the beautiest of this realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.08,0:40:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对所有人与陌生人略无二致\N{\fnArial\fs30}to all men and strangers are alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.15,0:40:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}照料他们的劳作服役 诉求\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took care of their servants, their tends,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.52,0:40:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及社区等任何方都面面面俱到\N{\fnArial\fs30}and their local communities in every sort of way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.89,0:40:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如同维护沟通的桥梁与屏障的堤坝\N{\fnArial\fs30}From maintaining bridges and seawalls.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.45,0:40:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看护少年男女纯洁的成长\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see girls and boys were brought up in virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.38,0:40:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当他们长大成人 人们不但有了他们躯体的重塑空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when they stood, people not only has world of refreshment in their bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.25,0:40:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时也有精神上的庇护所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they also have a spirtual refuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.95,0:40:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你对查封修道院与王权至尊愤懑不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you grudge this suppression and the King's supremacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.86,0:40:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}经过这番供述 上帝宽恕我们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}After such confessions, Lord forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.64,0:40:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这并非是阿斯克先生 而是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not Mr. Aske but you,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.36,0:41:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才是这造成这一切叛乱和灾难的源头和主因\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are the very oringal and chief cause of all this rebellion and mischief.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.03,0:41:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然你可设法按照你的意愿嫁祸于人\N{\fnArial\fs30}although You could probably find some ways of having all.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.06,0:41:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}砍掉王国之内一些贵族的头颅来自保\N{\fnArial\fs30}the nobal men's head of the realm struck off you if you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.75,0:41:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过我相信 哪怕只余下一个贵族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet I trust, there might be on left.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.51,0:41:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就还能最终砍下你的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}who can still to strike off yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.43,0:41:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你会感觉惊奇的得知 阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, may it surprise you to learn, Mr. Aske,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.31,0:41:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}基于特别的原因 我其实试图救你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is very reason, I attempt to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.09,0:42:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经回来两天了 虽然你不开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been here for 2 days. But still you don't talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.24,0:42:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却不想和我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though you are unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.85,0:42:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.94,0:42:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在半夜惊醒 喃喃自语\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wake in the night. You say things.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.68,0:42:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.70,0:42:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敞开你的心怀吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}unburden your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.35,0:42:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果那样 相信我 一切会变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I do, believe me, everything will change.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.70,0:43:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经接到命令要回北方去实施惩处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am commanded to return North to carry out retribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.29,0:43:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得去处决更多的叛乱者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must excute more rebels.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.35,0:43:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是此番我必须试行「正确」程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only this time I'll trial "proper" process.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.39,0:43:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很多？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.62,0:43:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 很多很多 成百上千\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, many. Many, hundreds, thousands,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.87,0:43:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不得不杀死成百上千的男人 女人甚至孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must kill hundreds of men, women or children.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.46,0:43:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则我会失去吾王的宠信\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'll lose the love of my King.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.02,0:43:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女人和孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women and children?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.94,0:43:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.86,0:43:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当然有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you have choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.21,0:43:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是你自己的孩子你会怎么去做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they were your own children?!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.57,0:43:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还得这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will still have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.98,0:44:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty, the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.07,0:44:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}起来吧 阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand up, Mr. Aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.49,0:44:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生已经向我禀报了你的供述\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Cromwell has reported your words to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.81,0:44:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此我特意前来和你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.88,0:44:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于你极度关心的修道院以及其他宗教设施\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the abbeys and the religious houses you care so much about.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.33,0:44:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.93,0:44:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你深爱那些修道士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have so much affection for these monks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.29,0:45:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我可向你证实 他们远非良善信徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet I can prove to you how far they are from good religious men.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.46,0:45:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们声称甘于贫穷 贞洁 服从\N{\fnArial\fs30}They claim to live in willful poverty, chastity and obedience.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.95,0:45:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却富甲一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet they mass possessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.20,0:45:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并享有法外制权\N{\fnArial\fs30}And put themselves outside the law,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.64,0:45:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们是宗教王公\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are religion princes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.70,0:45:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便这与我们无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Yet but out our responsibilities.*
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.90,0:45:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这难道就是所谓的甘守清贫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what is willful poverty anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.40,0:45:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于说到服从 上帝作证\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's for obedience, God help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.00,0:45:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他们连按照上帝诫令\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can they be obedient.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.13,0:45:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该服从其一切之最高统治者都不服从\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they disobliged their sovereign Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.26,0:45:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}服从又何从谈起\N{\fnArial\fs30}whom by God's commandments they ought to obey in all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.56,0:45:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们当然不能把这些人视作虔诚的修道人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should not think of these men as good religious men.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.54,0:45:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为好修道人会履行其抛弃世间财富之诺言\N{\fnArial\fs30}who forsake all earthly possessions as they claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.11,0:45:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倒不如说他们更像些闲人跟混混\N{\fnArial\fs30}But rather as idle and sturdy vagabonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.20,0:46:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我欣赏你 阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like you Mr.Aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.56,0:46:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你或许被某些事所误导 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're maybe misguiding certain matters, yes but,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.88,0:46:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的错误就在于诚实\N{\fnArial\fs30}your mistakes are honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.25,0:46:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道 在内心深处 你最忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that in your heart your are the most loyal of all men.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.46,0:46:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无比热爱尊敬您 国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love and respect Your Majesty, above all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.40,0:46:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从未企图冒犯您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never seek to offend you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.10,0:47:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 加莱的使者到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, the bellman from Calais is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.02,0:47:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 先生 让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - Monsieur. Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.40,0:47:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 鹌鹑蛋 弗兰西斯爵士 是鹌鹑蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - quail eggs, Sir Francis, quail eggs,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.08,0:47:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是送给王后的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}To feed the queen. Monsieur.
